Vendored for notez; upstream: pptx-preview 1.0.7 (npm). The bundled
dist exposes the `pptxPreview` global; entry point `pptxPreview.init(el, { mode })`
returns a viewer whose `.preview(arrayBuffer)` renders the slides.
